516	           `autoBackup`/`backupKeep` further down, never the charge. The real
517	           form submission (DeployView.tsx's hidden `backup_tier` input)
518	           already gets this right; this live preview call didn't, so
519	           checking Backup Plus never moved the total shown to the customer
520	           even though the actual charge at submission was correct. */
521	        backupTier: o.addons.includes("backup") ? "PLUS" : undefined,
