  return {
    eyebrow: "Free to start",
    title: "Start free —",
    highlight: "no card required",
    sub: `Create an account with no credit card, look around, and claim any free-credit offer in your dashboard. Servers you keep are billed monthly from ${fromLabel} for your first term${renewalNote} — all-in, no surprises.`,
    intro: [
      "Let's be straight with you: Nxeon doesn't hand out a permanently-free server, and neither does anyone reputable — someone always pays for the NVMe, the IP, the bandwidth, and the power. What we do offer is a genuinely free start: you can sign up with no credit card, explore the full dashboard, and see exactly what deploying a server looks like before you spend anything.",
      "When we're running promotions, free-credit and free-VPS offers show up right in your dashboard. If one's live, you claim it there and it covers your first server for the promo period. Because there's no card on file, nothing bills silently the moment a trial ends — you decide when (and whether) to start paying.",
      `After any free credit is used, servers you choose to keep are billed monthly, all-in, from ${fromLabel}/mo for the ${planName}. That price already includes a dedicated IPv4, DDoS protection, and daily backups — so when you do pay, you're getting a complete server, not a stripped trial box.`,
    ],
    whyTitle: "What 'free' really means here",
    why: [
      { title: "No credit card to sign up", body: "Create your account and explore the whole dashboard without entering payment details. Nothing can bill you by surprise, because there's no card on file." },
      { title: "Free-credit promos in-dashboard", body: "When offers are running, free-credit and free-VPS promos appear in your dashboard. If one's live, claim it there — it covers a server for the promo period." },
      { title: "See everything before you pay", body: "Walk through the deploy wizard, browse one-click images, and check out the plans and features before committing a cent." },
      { title: "Honest paid pricing", body: `Servers you keep bill monthly from ${fromLabel}, all-in. No metered egress, no per-feature add-ons — the plan price is the whole price.` },
      { title: "A complete server, not a trial stub", body: "Even the entry plan includes a dedicated IPv4, DDoS protection, a managed firewall, daily backups, and full root. Free-to-start doesn't mean feature-starved." },
      { title: "Cancel or resize any time", body: "Keep a server only as long as you want it, and use one-click resize to scale spend to what you actually use." },
    ],
    steps: [
      { title: "Sign up with no card", body: "Create your Nxeon account in seconds — no credit card, no payment details required to get in." },
      { title: "Check for a free offer", body: "Open your dashboard and look for any active free-credit or free-VPS promo. If one's live, claim it there." },
      { title: "Deploy and explore", body: "Launch a one-click OS or app image — median deploy is around 47 seconds — and kick the tyres with full root access." },
      { title: "Keep it or walk away", body: `Decide if it's worth keeping. Paid servers bill monthly from ${fromLabel}; if it's not for you, there's no card on file and nothing to cancel a charge on.` },
    ],
    specNote:
      `The ${fromLabel} ${planName} is the natural next step after any free credit — a complete server for a small site, bot, or dev box. Size up to Standard or Pro when you need more, and resize any time without a rebuild.`,
    faq: [
      { q: "Is there a truly free, permanent VPS?", a: `No — and we won't pretend otherwise. Nobody can give away a real server forever. What's free is getting started: no credit card to sign up, full access to the dashboard, and any free-credit promo we're running that you can claim in-app. Servers you keep are billed monthly from ${fromLabel}.` },
      { q: "How do I get free credit or a free trial?", a: "Sign up (no card needed) and check your dashboard. When promotions are active, free-credit and free-VPS offers appear there for you to claim. Availability changes over time, so the dashboard is always the source of truth." },
      { q: "Will I be charged automatically after a trial?", a: "No. There's no credit card required to sign up, so nothing bills silently when free credit runs out. Your server simply pauses or you're prompted to add payment — you stay in control of when paid billing starts." },
      { q: "What does it cost once the free part ends?", a: `Servers you keep are billed monthly, all-in, from ${fromLabel}/mo for the ${planName}. That includes a dedicated IPv4, DDoS protection, a managed firewall, and daily backups — no surprise egress or add-on charges.` },
      { q: "What can I do during the free start?", a: "Everything except run a paid server for free: explore the dashboard, walk the deploy wizard, browse one-click images and plans, and — if a promo is live — deploy a real server on free credit with full root access." },
    ],
    related: [
      { label: "Cheap VPS", href: "/cheap-vps-hosting" },
      { label: "Affordable VPS", href: "/affordable-vps-hosting" },
      { label: "Best value VPS", href: "/best-value-vps" },
      { label: "VPS hosting", href: "/vps" },
      { label: "Pricing", href: "/pricing" },
    ],
  };
}

