 *     mechanic the owner asked for after being shown that a per-visitor timer
 *     that always reads ~96 minutes for every new visitor across a 7-day
 *     campaign is the exact fact pattern the FTC's 2023 rule on deceptive
 *     countdown timers and several state UDAP actions have targeted — an
 *     informed, explicit choice (2026-09-22), not an oversight. Enforcement
 *     is server-side against `PromoSighting.firstSeenAt`, never a client-
